Short:        Screen snapshots of Dice 3.0 C Compiler
Author:       Bryce Craig Nesbitt (bryce@uclink.berkeley.edu)
Uploader:     Geoff Seeley (geoff softwords bc ca)
Type:         dev/c
Architecture: m68k-amigaos
Date:         November 19, 1994

---

This archive contains two IFF screen captures of the Dice 3.0
C compilers GUI interface as well as a text file on the features
of Dice 3.0 and how to order it. Thanks go to Bryce "The Enforcer"
Nesbitt for sending these snapshots to me when I whined "Well what
does the GUI look like?" :-)
                                                                             
